UnitDeployCanonGuardFactories
├── when deploying to ethereum mainnet
│   ├── it should deploy the common factories
│   └── it should deploy the ethereum factories
│   └── it should deploy the common actions
│   └── it should deploy the ethereum actions
├── when deploying to optimism mainnet
│   ├── it should deploy the common factories
│   └── it should deploy the optimism factories
│   └── it should deploy the common actions
│   └── it should deploy the optimism actions
└── when deploying to a non supported chain
    └── it should revert

